{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"880224162440962108","content":"1/2 cover is +2 AC\n3/4 cover is +5 AC\nFull keeps them from being targeted, idk if this applies here","created_at":"2021-08-26T04:15:55.918000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880304532930842694","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"880224162440962108","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:10:45.389000Z","id":"880257931994599494","name":"Finale OOC"},"thread_id":"880257931994599494"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Srg. Waffles","id":"430898830498725888","is_bot":0,"username":"srg.waffles"},"author_id":"430898830498725888","channel_id":"880224162440962108","content":"jig taking their lunch money or something?","created_at":"2021-08-26T04:16:09.025000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"880304587905576972","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"880224162440962108","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:10:45.389000Z","id":"880257931994599494","name":"Finale OOC"},"thread_id":"880257931994599494"}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Noah","id":"360967589511561218","is_bot":0,"username":"king.crusader"},"author_id":"360967589511561218","channel_id":"880224162440962108","content":"> A target with half cover has a +2 bonus to AC and Dexterity saving throws. A target has half cover if an obstacle blocks at least half of its body. The obstacle might be a low wall, a large piece of furniture, a narrow tree trunk, or a creature, whether that creature is an enemy or a friend.\n> \n> A target with three-quarters cover has a +5 bonus to AC and Dexterity saving throws. A target has three-quarters cover if about three-quarters of it is covered by an obstacle. The obstacle might be a portcullis, an arrow slit, or a thick tree trunk.\n> \n> A target with total cover can't be targeted directly by an attack or a spell, although some spells can reach such a target by including it in an area of effect. A target has total cover if it is completely concealed by an obstacle.","created_at":"2021-08-26T04:16:15.155000Z","edited_at":"2021-08-26T04:16:21.515000Z","id":"880304613616676945","reply_to_id":null,"thread":{"archived":1,"channel_id":"880224162440962108","created_at":"2021-08-26T01:10:45.389000Z","id":"880257931994599494","name":"Finale OOC"},"thread_id":"880257931994599494"}
